```xml
<soap:Envelope
    xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/"
    xmlns:hs="http://hospital.example.com/service">

    <soap:Header>
        <hs:Authentication>
            <hs:UserId>doctor101</hs:UserId>
            <hs:Token>ABC123XYZ</hs:Token>
        </hs:Authentication>
    </soap:Header>

    <soap:Body>
        <hs:GetMedicalRecord>
            <hs:PatientId>P1001</hs:PatientId>
        </hs:GetMedicalRecord>
    </soap:Body>

</soap:Envelope>
```
## 1.4 SOAP Response

The server processes the request and returns a SOAP response.

```xml
<soap:Envelope
    xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/"
    xmlns:hs="http://hospital.example.com/service">

    <soap:Body>
        <hs:GetMedicalRecordResponse>
            <hs:PatientId>P1001</hs:PatientId>
            <hs:Diagnosis>Fever</hs:Diagnosis>
            <hs:Doctor>Dr. Kumar</hs:Doctor>
            <hs:VisitDate>2026-08-20</hs:VisitDate>
        </hs:GetMedicalRecordResponse>
    </soap:Body>

</soap:Envelope>
```

