## 1.5 Major Operations

### Operation 1: Add Patient

```text
addPatient(patientId, name, age, gender, contact)
```

This operation registers a new patient in the hospital system.

### Operation 2: Get Patient

```text
getPatient(patientId)
```

This operation retrieves patient information.

### Operation 3: Schedule Appointment

```text
scheduleAppointment(patientId, doctorId, date, time)
```

This operation schedules an appointment with a doctor.

### Operation 4: Get Medical Records

```text
getMedicalRecord(patientId)
```

This operation retrieves the patient's medical history.

### Operation 5: Update Medical Record

```text
updateMedicalRecord(patientId, diagnosis, prescription)
```

This operation allows authorized medical staff to update records.

### Operation 6: Cancel Appointment

```text
cancelAppointment(appointmentId)
```

